[{"id":176472797,"discussion_id":"65c992f9296133c51f015c8e3257b60dc23597bf","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| mc2 | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo), [*liuboxi*](https://gitcode.com/liuboxi) (2/2) | ✅ [*wang-minbo*](https://gitcode.com/wang-minbo) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n sangzhenguo, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-22T10:49:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-23T22:09:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176475661,"discussion_id":"2bf1f6c8c9be90f3f06643e57e1ff597ecc8c4e3","body":"现在我已经掌握了所有必要信息，直接输出变更摘要。\n\n#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `matmul_reduce_scatter_v2` 算子在 AIV 模式 Tiling 阶段，因 `uint32_t`/`int32_t` 类型乘法在转换为 `uint64_t` 之前可能发生溢出/截断的风险。核心思路是将 `static_cast<uint64_t>` 从整个表达式外层移动到第一个乘法操作数上，利用 C++ 的整型提升规则，使整个乘法链提前提升至 64 位计算，避免中间结果溢出。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **输出空间检查溢出修复**: 在 `checkAndResetTilingData_SmallM` 中，将 `(info.M * info.N / rankSize * elementSize)` 的表达式中第一个操作数 `info.M` 显式转换为 `uint64_t`，防止 `info.M * info.N`（两者均为 `uint32_t`）在比较前溢出。\n- **对齐大小计算溢出修复**: 在 `GetUsrWorkSpaceSize` 中，`info.aAlignSize` 和 `info.bAlignSize` 的计算由原先 `static_cast<uint64_t>(整个三元表达式 * elementSize)` 改为在各自分支中将 `info.M`、`info.K`、`info.N` 提前转换为 `uint64_t` 后再参与乘法，确保三元表达式内部的乘法不会在 32 位下溢出。\n- **反量化工作空间计算溢出修复**: 同一函数中 `info.dequantSize` 的计算，小 m 场景由 `static_cast<uint64_t>(mAlign * nAlign * sizeof(int32_t))` 改为 `static_cast<uint64_t>(mAlign) * nAlign * sizeof(int32_t)`；大 m 场景同理，将 `cocTilingData.pValue` 提前转换为 `uint64_t`，移除多层嵌套的 `static_cast` 宏括号，确保从首个操作数即进入 64 位精度。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T10:59:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T10:59:30+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176476417,"discussion_id":"e3457e4a1932ab36b28cf8459fd67ddc8f20f5ff","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-22T11:01:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T11:01:47+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176589963,"discussion_id":"11e0c6b8d9ed358c6031c70c5e073f3c4c7bbdad","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-22T20:25:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-22T20:25:13+08:00","user":{"id":"693a77ca33ea21694539f7f1","login":"sangzhenguo","object_id":"693a77ca33ea21694539f7f1","name":"sangzhenguo","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/sa